# the FILTERS page (0.15.15): the synths' filter types, low (as before), high, band, notch, peak, for the pad's saw sounds, the bass and the acid
# (EN_FXS_FT_PAD 74, _BASS 75, _ACID 76). 0.16.28: the first page of the settings walk, and the piece's own: saved with it (GLO, SAVE), back to the
# defaults on a piece that has none (a factory piece, one saved before), kept while you stay in the genre
seed 0
seamless 1
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 0
wait 100
expect fxpage 27
expect fxs74 0
expect fxs75 0
expect fxs76 0
spin K2 1
spin K3 2
spin K1 4
wait 300
expect fxs74 4
expect fxs75 1
expect fxs76 2
shot filters_page.png
tap FX
wait 300
# another piece: its own (the defaults); back: as left
turn PRESET 1
wait 1500
expect piece 1
expect fxs74 0
expect fxs76 0
turn PRESET -1
wait 1500
expect piece 0
expect fxs74 4
expect fxs75 1
expect fxs76 2
# not saved: a power-on is the defaults
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect piece 0
expect fxs74 0
expect fxs75 0
expect fxs76 0
# set again and saved with the piece: a power-on brings them back
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
spin K1 2
spin K3 3
wait 300
tap FX
wait 300
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 1
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect piece 0
expect fxs74 2
expect fxs75 0
expect fxs76 3
# another piece still the defaults
turn PRESET 1
wait 1500
expect fxs74 0
expect fxs76 0
